I really feel that you should not need to hack the edgeR code in this way.

If the above hasn't already answered your questions, can you describe more 
precisely the plot you are tring to create?  Are you trying to plot the 
logCPM for each sample, or for each experimental group, or just the logFC? 
What are you trying to learn?

